  "findings": [
    "13 final inflight chunks are not already included in accepted1605120: ordered request IDs2634925401..2634925413 cover [1605120,1611360), exactly6240=13*480 samples. No observed final-plateau double reservation.",
    "Final credit plateau free13/inflight13/statusqueued17 gives queued+reserved30. Current conservative policy stops sends while old status is retained and rendered audio continues arriving.",
    "RID2634925400 ACK at97016.745771683 covers the last chunk ending1605120. RID2634925401 was sent97016.727649423 and acknowledged97016.927591913 near observed UNDERRUN, accepted unchanged1605120. Later pending ACKs are not retained before STOP clears the window.",
    "wav_inflight tuple is only(sent_monotonic,kind); it has no offset/session/count. Request-ID-to-offset pairing here uses each chunk log and its immediately following send trace within5ms. All13 final IDs are unique, ordered, and separated from their chunk log by<0.03ms.",
    "MCU wav::submit calls poll first, then accepts chunk only when session/offset match and PLAYING queue has at least2blocks. On starvation it can return stateUNDERRUN/reasonBUSY for a late chunk. State4/reason2 therefore does not establish a credit-accounting bug.",
    "Relay receives at most one PC command per valid SPI iteration, then transmits it at the next iteration; MCU emits a queued reply on a following exchange. TCP sendall confirms local handoff only. Trace has no relay command-ingress/SPI request timestamps to localize the delay."
  ],
  "probable_cause": "End-to-end refill command/ACK starvation while pending credits occupy available window. Host DSP audio is present. Current final plateau contradicts double reservation of chunks already cumulatively accepted; location of command transit/ACK delay is unresolved.",
  "reproduction_plan": [
    "Offline fake receiver/source with30slots, PLAYING accepted1605120/free13/played1596960,13pending kind13 entries spanning offsets1605120..1610880, next1611360 and >20000host samples: service_wav sends0 under credits gate; delay first ACK then deliver UNDERRUN/BUSY and verify window clears without hidden retry.",
    "Before implementation, add a bounded diagnostic send record(request_id,kind,session,offset,count) and full ACK record(request_id,accepted,played,free,state,reason). Check exact pending-range/cumulative-acceptance invariants using that evidence.",
    "If later physically authorized, correlate host send with relay recv/SPI transmitted request IDs and MCU reply timestamps. Preserve binaries and failed qualification; no selective retry."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Transport ring covers only about1.507s; WAV recent stores only the final WAV status per pump, so per-request accepted/free/state payload is incomplete.",
    "Timestamps measure host observation, not exact DAC playback or SPI transit. Large read/decode servicing gaps and batched ACKs do not prove where commands stalled.",
    "Paired request offsets are inferred from adjacent synchronous instrumentation, not decoded send payload. Final13 pairings all exist and match the sample deficit exactly.",
    "Rendered feed and receiver service events come from different threads. Ring append order is not temporal order; final_refill_events is sorted by recorded start time.",
    "Reader gap135ms/decode81ms alone does not imply ADC loss; recorded dropped/fatal are both0.",
    "Prior service/state snapshots can be stale. The unchanged cumulative accepted at observed UNDERRUN is strong evidence no further audio had been accepted by that terminal state, but does not locate the forwarding delay."
  ]
